  "guide": {
    "feature_id": "meta.customer-list-custom-audiences",
    "name": "Customer list Custom Audiences",
    "vendor": "Meta",
    "platform": "Paid Social",
    "capability_ids": [
      "meta.custom_audiences.customer-list-custom-audience"
    ],
    "sections": [
      {
        "kind": "definition",
        "summary": "",
        "status": "documented",
        "claims": [
          {
            "text": "A customer list Custom Audience lets you upload your own customer data so Meta can find those people across its technologies and target them in Ads Manager. Easy to get wrong: a match is not a guarantee that everyone on your list is reachable.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "meta.guide.customer_list",
                "source_url": "https://www.facebook.com/business/help/170456843145568",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "Meta Business Help Centre",
                "source_title": "Create a customer list custom audience",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "It is built from your own customer data, which can be prepared with data formatting and hashed customer information.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "meta.custom_audiences",
                "source_url": "https://www.facebook.com/business/help/744354708981227",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "Meta Business Help Centre",
                "source_title": "About custom audiences",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "An exclusion-only variant exists. It is a customer list audience that can only be used to exclude people from your ad audience.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "meta.custom_audiences",
                "source_url": "https://www.facebook.com/business/help/744354708981227",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "Meta Business Help Centre",
                "source_title": "About custom audiences",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "summary": "",
        "status": "documented",
        "claims": [
          {
            "text": "You upload a customer list. Meta hashes it, which turns identifiers into code that cannot be reversed and is unidentifiable at an individual level, then uses it to match customers to profiles. Hashing can take a few minutes depending on list size.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "meta.guide.customer_list",
                "source_url": "https://www.facebook.com/business/help/170456843145568",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "Meta Business Help Centre",
                "source_title": "Create a customer list custom audience",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "The audience shows as Populating in Audiences while creation finishes. You can then build an ad for it or create a lookalike audience from it.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "meta.guide.customer_list",
                "source_url": "https://www.facebook.com/business/help/170456843145568",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "Meta Business Help Centre",
                "source_title": "Create a customer list custom audience",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "Audience options are limited where the audience includes people under 18 (or older in some countries). Campaigns reaching people in Europe may also be affected by privacy-related changes.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "meta.guide.customer_list",
                "source_url": "https://www.facebook.com/business/help/170456843145568",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "Meta Business Help Centre",
                "source_title": "Create a customer list custom audience",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "You can create up to 500 custom audiences per ad account.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "meta.custom_audiences",
                "source_url": "https://www.facebook.com/business/help/744354708981227",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "Meta Business Help Centre",
                "source_title": "About custom audiences",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "use_cases",
        "summary": "",
        "status": "documented",
        "claims": [
          {
            "text": "Use it when you hold first-party customer records and want to reach those existing customers on Meta, build a lookalike audience from them, or exclude them from prospecting.",
            "status": "inferred",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "meta.guide.customer_list",
                "source_url": "https://www.facebook.com/business/help/170456843145568",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "Meta Business Help Centre",
                "source_title": "Create a customer list custom audience",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              },
              {
                "source_id": "meta.custom_audiences",
                "source_url": "https://www.facebook.com/business/help/744354708981227",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "Meta Business Help Centre",
                "source_title": "About custom audiences",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "Do not rely on it when you lack a legal basis for the data. Under GDPR, you act as data controller for any list you upload, so check Meta's terms first.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "meta.guide.customer_list",
                "source_url": "https://www.facebook.com/business/help/170456843145568",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "Meta Business Help Centre",
                "source_title": "Create a customer list custom audience",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "Do not rely on it when your audience includes under-18s or you advertise in Europe and expect full targeting options. Both can limit what you can do.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "meta.guide.customer_list",
                "source_url": "https://www.facebook.com/business/help/170456843145568",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "Meta Business Help Centre",
                "source_title": "Create a customer list custom audience",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "setup",
        "summary": "The documented steps cover creation up to the audience populating. The file upload and field-mapping screens are not documented by Meta, so this path stops there.",
        "status": "documented",
        "claims": [
          {
            "text": "Open Audiences in Ads Manager.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "meta.guide.customer_list",
                "source_url": "https://www.facebook.com/business/help/170456843145568",
                "locator": "Create a customer list custom audience in Ads Manager",
                "source_site": "Meta Business Help Centre",
                "source_title": "Create a customer list custom audience",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "Select Create audience, then Custom audience. If you have not created an audience before, select Create a custom audience.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "meta.guide.customer_list",
                "source_url": "https://www.facebook.com/business/help/170456843145568",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "Meta Business Help Centre",
                "source_title": "Create a customer list custom audience",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "Select Customer list, then Next.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "meta.guide.customer_list",
                "source_url": "https://www.facebook.com/business/help/170456843145568",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "Meta Business Help Centre",
                "source_title": "Create a customer list custom audience",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "Select Import and create.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "meta.guide.customer_list",
                "source_url": "https://www.facebook.com/business/help/170456843145568",
                "locator": null,
                "source_site": "Meta Business Help Centre",
                "source_title": "Create a customer list custom audience",
                "raw_sha256": null,
                "cleaned_sha256": null
              }
            ],
            "conditions": []
          },
          {
            "text": "Return to Audiences and wait while the audience shows Populating.",
            "status": "documented",
            "evidence": [
              {
                "source_id": "meta.guide.customer_list",
                "source_url": "https://www.facebook.com/business/help/170456843145568",
